    "comment": "Rawang (raw-raw) = 3 (Wider communication). Of Mongolian descent, the Rawang migrated to northern Burma in the second millennium. Became widespread in the early 1800s under British rule. Used at home, in education, farming, church, and gospel radio broadcasts."
